{"page":115,"width":1830,"height":2403,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 I 데이터 모일랑의 이해","words":[{"text":"과목","x":169,"y":85,"width":56,"height":29},{"text":"I","x":251,"y":86,"width":12,"height":28},{"text":"데이터","x":287,"y":84,"width":81,"height":28},{"text":"모일랑의","x":385,"y":83,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"이해","x":507,"y":82,"width":52,"height":29}]},{"text":"가장 기본적이면서 일반적인 액세스 패턴이다. 이러한 SQL에 대해 본질식별자로 구성하면 PK 인덱스를 활용할","words":[{"text":"가장","x":204,"y":230,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"기본적이면서","x":274,"y":232,"width":166,"height":34},{"text":"일반적인","x":454,"y":232,"width":111,"height":34},{"text":"액세스","x":578,"y":232,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"패턴이다.","x":673,"y":232,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"이러한","x":808,"y":233,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"SQL에","x":903,"y":233,"width":82,"height":38},{"text":"대해","x":998,"y":233,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"본질식별자로","x":1065,"y":233,"width":169,"height":34},{"text":"구성하면","x":1245,"y":231,"width":113,"height":34},{"text":"PK","x":1371,"y":235,"width":41,"height":26},{"text":"인덱스를","x":1425,"y":231,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"활용할","x":1552,"y":229,"width":92,"height":34}]},{"text":"수 있겠지만, 인조식별자로 구성한다면 [그림 1-2251의 1X1과 같은 인덱스를 추가로 생성해주어야 할 것이다.","words":[{"text":"수","x":165,"y":284,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"있겠지만,","x":210,"y":285,"width":123,"height":38},{"text":"인조식별자로","x":349,"y":286,"width":173,"height":34},{"text":"구성한다면","x":534,"y":286,"width":142,"height":34},{"text":"[그림","x":692,"y":287,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"1-2251의","x":782,"y":286,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"1X1과","x":922,"y":286,"width":76,"height":34},{"text":"같은","x":1012,"y":287,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"인덱스를","x":1083,"y":287,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"추가로","x":1210,"y":285,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"생성해주어야","x":1310,"y":284,"width":175,"height":35},{"text":"할","x":1499,"y":282,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"것이다.","x":1545,"y":281,"width":96,"height":35}]},{"text":"즉 인조식별자를 사용한